{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"gem_ruby","model_identifier":"gem_ruby","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## gem_ruby\n\nSmall prop, gem.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 16x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.5..1.5, y -1.8..1.5, z -2.5..0.5 (size 3.0 x 3.2 x 3.0 u = 8 x 9 x 8 cm).\nCut ruby, red (~8 cm, exaggerated so it reads): a stepped crown, girdle and pavilion with bright facet pixels. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.8.\n"},"description":"## gem_ruby\n\nSmall prop, gem.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 16x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.5..1.5, y -1.8..1.5, z -2.5..0.5 (size 3.0 x 3.2 x 3.0 u = 8 x 9 x 8 cm).\nCut ruby, red (~8 cm, exaggerated so it reads): a stepped crown, girdle and pavilion with bright facet pixels. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.8.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"crown","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.25,0.5,-2.25],"to":[1.25,1.5,0.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,3,2.5,4.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[3,3,5.5,4.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[6,3,8.5,4.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[9,3,11.5,4.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,2.5,2.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[3,0,5.5,2.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"063414f8-5b16-57e2-a9df-7b52b7820b11"},{"name":"girdle","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,-0.25,-2.5],"to":[1.5,0.5,0.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate